{"reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "第五次康波是以信息技术为核心驱动、约1991-2025年（主流划分）的60年超长经济周期，是信息革命推动全球经济增长与资产价格波动。\n标志性技术：互联网、移动通信、半导体、计算机等信息技术，美国是主导者，中国等后发国家承接技术扩散。\n\n阶段划分（周金涛框架）：\n繁荣（1991-2004）：互联网商业化、中国入世，经济高增长、资产普涨。\n衰退（2004-2015）：技术红利减弱，2008 年金融危机爆发，增长放缓。\n萧条（2015-2025）：产能过剩、资产调整、低增长，技术红利接近耗尽。\n\n带来的影响\n产业：电商、移动支付、云计算等崛起，重塑商业模式与就业结构。\n财富：1991-2004年买房、投科技股的人多吃到资产长牛红利，2004年后资产波动加大，赚钱难度上升。\n现状：2025年前后处于萧条末期，即将向第六次康波（AI、新能源驱动）过渡。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "第五次康波的标志性技术创新为信息技术", "range": "2764-2782", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766544053, "userEditTime": 1775553094, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 163, "likes": [{"userVid": 924415418, "name": "晨辉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/FBVwLwD1StcNRLMH2svSKxc6tntp79cuOCXaZJ4AK2d1vrLedUcp4Ficm4V3XdAPWAkTb56cQCadoJEIZPTiaWUfP8xomE3FZAyFaatBsj15w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-1-0-H-0-0-0", "desc": "微信读书·学生勋章", "title": "学生认证", "levelIndex": 1}}], "commentsCount": 11, "hotComments": [{"reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "content": "我理解是熊和周的框架划分不太一样，熊是站在未来看过去，刚好过去每个周期都有一个较为清晰的重大技术变革节点可以作为繁荣时期的起点，因此50-60年长波是一个弹性区间。但事实上技术的迭代有时连贯有时断断续续，技术爆发式落地时容易让回升期变得极短（周框架的信息技术周期）。再叠加08年金融危机、15年全球产能过剩等冲击会在一定程度上压缩衰退和萧条期，只能选取技术密度大、经济增长速度快的那几年作为繁荣时期的参考。当前全球经济明显回落调整，新的技术节点（AI、新能源、生物技术）进入产业化临界点，资产价格波动大，符合康波萧条末期特征。", "toUserVid": 215792425, "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c215792425_86iok4Xlc", "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c254854030_86juwsa64", "userVid": 254854030, "createTime": 1768957700, "likesCount": 19, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 215792425, "name": "嘉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELZ6Rnw0BtLrUvvhPTJpx9ED6OzOkda4QALUe1Fvk1yU9FWt7aFtwXBT2OnrW2Tr4wa8jgQzu7t2qqZ0tl2PAhiaB8wiblORBZd1yYIk0uicaAtQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240115-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "根据主流经济学观点，目前（2026年）正处于第五次康波周期的萧条期末端，同时是第六次康波周期的复苏期起点。是一个新旧周期交替的关键拐点。", "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c24479016_86K4Fs2pS", "toUserVid": 24479016, "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c407618026_87uYLqOVz", "userVid": 407618026, "createTime": 1773131823, "l