点。", "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c24479016_86K4Fs2pS", "toUserVid": 24479016, "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c407618026_87uYLqOVz", "userVid": 407618026, "createTime": 1773131823, "likesCount": 12, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 407618026, "name": "星🌟晏🧂", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-HffLK~o2p~wngJj7axahad1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "星🌟晏🧂", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 24479016, "name": "归蝉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/S4eZ1S9NekCAEQnvfrshB8SCRUac54L1P8HuCy6Pqmlk63CgptLZHNZRkkTukO1RHJAfpKCRgv5vbqG8PI4WA9nLL3cDlj63xctbjSyibS0s/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "归蝉", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230731-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "content": "好，谢谢答复", "toUserVid": 407618026, "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c407618026_87uYLqOVz", "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c24479016_87v4eKD5z", "userVid": 24479016, "createTime": 1773136837, "author": {"userVid": 24479016, "name": "归蝉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/S4eZ1S9NekCAEQnvfrshB8SCRUac54L1P8HuCy6Pqmlk63CgptLZHNZRkkTukO1RHJAfpKCRgv5vbqG8PI4WA9nLL3cDlj63xctbjSyibS0s/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "归蝉", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230731-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 407618026, "name": "星🌟晏🧂", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-HffLK~o2p~wngJj7axahad1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "星🌟晏🧂", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}}, {"content": "我有一个疑问，康波周期一般为60年，分为四个阶段，那每个阶段应该15年左右。但是现在这种划分，每个阶段只有约10年。划分的是不是不太准确，现在真的是萧条末期吗？", "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c215792425_86iok4Xlc", "userVid": 215792425, "createTime": 1768895221, "author": {"userVid": 215792425, "name": "嘉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELZ6Rnw0BtLrUvvhPTJpx9ED6OzOkda4QALUe1Fvk1yU9FWt7aFtwXBT2OnrW2Tr4wa8jgQzu7t2qqZ0tl2PAhiaB8wiblORBZd1yYIk0uicaAtQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240115-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "肯定不准确  看今年经济就知道了  我觉得真的萧条期是2023年到2034年  之前有一个学者说过   而1991到2014这23年是繁荣期  之前繁荣期都是二十年   2015到2023是衰退期23年到34年是萧条   今年比去年还难找到工作", "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c215792425_86iok4Xlc", "toUserVid": 215792425, "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c45640331_8cyI501D0", "userVid": 45640331, "createTime": 1790951811, "author": {"userVid": 45640331, "name": "*cherryrain_ya 🍅", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIicFJvftxS1jLRkjycFPQhP7OdyZWlzxG2ywGSMwWoibMjebWJ6ialfxiaBiaC9zVfAcLPXMCibIibc2icI73A7f0icFLIQxNLsydW0H9rFrnU5Ith25w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 215792425, "name": "嘉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELZ6Rnw0BtLrUvvhPTJpx9ED6OzOkda4QALUe1Fvk1yU9FWt7aFtwXBT2OnrW2Tr4wa8jgQzu7t2qqZ0tl2PAhiaB8wiblORBZd1yYIk0uicaAtQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240115-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "content": "我理解是熊和周的框架划分不太一样，熊是站在未来看过去，刚好过去每个周期都有一个较为清晰的重大技术变革节点可以作为繁荣时期的起点，因此50-60年长波是一个弹性区间。但事实上技术的迭代有时连贯有时断断续续，技术爆发式落地时容易让回升期变得极短（周框架的信息技术周期）。再叠加08年金融危机、15年全球产能过剩等冲击会在一定程度上压缩衰退和萧条期，只能选取技术密度大、经济增长速度快的那几年作为繁荣时期的参考。当前全球经济明显回落调整，新的技术节点（AI、新能源、生物技术）进入产业化临界点，资产价格波动大，符合康波萧条末期特征。", "toUserVid": 215792425, "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c215792425_86iok4Xlc", "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c254854030_86juwsa64", "userVid": 254854030, "createTime": 1768957700, "likesCount": 19, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 215792425, "name": "嘉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELZ6Rnw0BtLrUvvhPTJpx9ED6OzOkda4QALUe1Fvk1yU9FWt7aFtwXBT2OnrW2Tr4wa8jgQzu7t2qqZ0tl2PAhiaB8wiblORBZd1yYIk0uicaAtQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240115-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "愿望当然是美好的，全球来看，很多方面都在往上，但衰退的大势在延续甚至加剧，比如欧洲。中国和亚洲在向好，日韩港台新的大类资产都在走强，但中国大陆却还在波动，特别是房地产仍然没有触底。", "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c254854030_86juwsa64", "toUserVid": 254854030, "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c233883411_89GDZdS2K", "userVid": 233883411, "createTime": 1780837620, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 233883411, "name": "夢想之路", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/rKBCaRcVshOibD07LJrpH3WAomLy16tv7PFud7toakSktKaetuqZRcUZFtrg6IIayQatA2z94YTc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "了解啦，谢谢解答", "reviewId": "254854030_85CZUXykV", "toCommentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c254854030_86juwsa64", "toUserVid": 254854030, "commentId": "254854030_85CZUXykV_c215792425_86k1mroQs", "userVid": 215792425, "createTime": 1768987785, "author": {"userVid": 215792425, "name": "嘉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELZ6Rnw0BtLrUvvhPTJpx9ED6OzOkda4QALUe1Fvk1yU9FWt7aFtwXBT2OnrW2Tr4wa8jgQzu7t2qqZ0tl2PAhiaB8wiblORBZd1yYIk0uicaAtQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240115-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"